  "content": "<blockquote>\n<p><strong>警告</strong>：此專案目前非常不穩定，正在進行全面重寫與品牌重塑。重寫完成後，此頁面將會封存，並以新名稱重新發布。如有任何疑問，歡迎在我的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/wjPt4vEfXb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a> 詢問。</p>\n</blockquote><hr><p><img src=\"https://github.com/PandaDap2006/Pandas-Extra-Details/blob/master/assets_for_readme/banner.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\"></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/wjPt4vEfXb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1021703635178115122?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;label=Discord&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=lightblue\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpandas-extra-details\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/RQ7OrTFx?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;label=Modrinth&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=green\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pandas-extra-details\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/883585?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;label=Curseforge&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=red\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/PandaDap2006/Pandas-Extra-Details/tree/master\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/PandaDap2006/Pandas-Extra-Details?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;label=Github&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=white\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Architectury API-REQUIRED-1?style=for-the-badge&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=gold\" alt=\"Architecury API\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Cloth Config-REQUIRED-1?style=for-the-badge&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=gold\" alt=\"Cloth Config\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric API-REQUIRED for Fabric-1?style=for-the-badge&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=gold\" alt=\"Fabric API\"></a></p><h2>關於：</h2><p>此模組旨在為原本沒有動畫與細節的方塊，添加上小巧的動畫與細節。</p><h2>展示：</h2><p><img src=\"https://github.com/PandaDap2006/Pandas-Extra-Details/blob/master/assets_for_readme/showcase_door_animation.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"門動畫\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/PandaDap2006/Pandas-Extra-Details/blob/master/assets_for_readme/showcase_trap_door_animation.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"地板門動畫\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/PandaDap2006/Pandas-Extra-Details/blob/master/assets_for_readme/showcase_standing_sign.png?raw=true\" alt=\"直立告示牌傾斜\"></p><h2>常見問題：</h2><ul>\n<li>[問] 這個模組是客戶端專用的嗎？\n<ul>\n<li>[答] 是的，這個模組 100% 是客戶端專用的。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>[問] 未來是否計劃為模組增加更多功能？\n<ul>\n<li>[答] 是的，我一直在尋找更多酷炫的細節加入遊戲中。如果你有任何想法，歡迎在我的 Discord 伺服器 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/wjPt4vEfXb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a> 提出。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>[問] 此模組支援資源包嗎？\n<ul>\n<li>[答] 支援，但對於模組有修改的原版方塊，將不支援自訂模型。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul><hr><h2>贊助我</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fS6S0WO38H\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg\" alt=\"ko-fi\"></a></p>",
